  "adaptations": {
    "components": "Existing control.Switch, FieldWith/FieldScope and native label-target association. Whole choice cards label the single native Switch; no duplicate button target or manual toggle callback.",
    "styles": "Pinned kit Vega track sizes: Small24x14 DIPs, default32x18.4. Source horizontal Field gap12 vs plain label gap8, docs FieldGroup gap28 vs Create gap48, max-sm384 and docs Sizes160 are retained. Native font line boxes can differ from CSS. Plain Label rows explicitly use leading-none (native LineHeight1) and font-medium500; Field labels retain Field typography.",
    "state": "Each source configuration has independent application booleans and original defaults; RTL languages share their one source value. Pointer/Space reports one current callback per native activation; disabled remains native. Local status records intent only.",
    "menus": "Configuration/language selectors follow the global Flyout vs Native menu backend; switch itself remains a themed native SwitchBase in both routes.",
    "scope": "Only values and public state persist; no frame Context, Element or FieldScope is retained. No new fonts, icon fonts, assets or dependencies.",
    "acceptance": "Public Tester/software PNG and injected selector backend are not real OS/AT/IME/font/platform acceptance."
  }
